92
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:22,197
Were they telling me that Luffy and the
others could make it out on their own?

93
00:04:22,280 --> 00:04:27,045
Now that I know the formula for the drug
and have the sedatives, I can help them.

94
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:30,380
I have no idea which way to go!

95
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:34,417
Tell me what my men are doing about this

96
00:04:34,500 --> 00:04:36,717
troops have mobilized
against them in building

97
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:39,657
a the main unit They're posted at the back

98
00:04:39,740 --> 00:04:42,320
of building B preparing
to make a stand sir

99
00:04:42,940 --> 00:04:46,480
We know what they're after
escape away off the island

100
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:49,877
And that means we know
where they're heading.

101
