to let you get away, Straw Hats.

145
00:07:22,780 --> 00:07:24,400
You've got nowhere to run.

146
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:25,737
Back down.

147
00:07:25,820 --> 00:07:28,260
Get out of our way! Ha!

148
00:07:29,900 --> 00:07:30,730
Hot!

149
00:07:32,220 --> 00:07:33,050
Cool!

150
00:07:36,280 --> 00:07:37,110
Yeah!

151
00:07:37,193 --> 00:07:38,023
That's our boys!

152
00:07:38,240 --> 00:07:39,100
Way to go!

153
