our original plan was to get away from
the poison gas by flying on his back

159
00:07:56,320 --> 00:08:02,217
but he never even got off the ground he
can't fly now because he's been injected

160
00:08:02,300 --> 00:08:07,737
with sedatives even so it would have been
a better idea to leave him outside and

161
00:08:07,820 --> 00:08:13,340
here he could do a lot of damage he's
dangerous really he's kind of cute though

162
00:08:17,140 --> 00:08:20,717
this might be our only chance
let's take the stars down

163
00:08:20,800 --> 00:08:25,177
now I thought I told you to

164
00:08:25,260 --> 00:08:28,857
get out of our way huh but

165
00:08:28,940 --> 00:08:34,077
captain why well hello copycat
a captain now huh what's

166
00:08:34,160 --> 00:08:35,837
wrong don't want to fight me

167
00:08:35,920 --> 00:08:42,297
no get the hell out of here stop

168
00:08:42,380 --> 00:08:46,237
g5 we don't have the time to
be fighting right now head

169
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:50,557
for the back passage immediately
the only way out of this

170
00:08:50,640 --> 00:08:53,257
building is about to be
sealed we need to get out now

171
00:08:53,340 --> 00:08:57,040
caesar's ordered the gate closed
he's trying to fence us in

172
00:08:58,760 --> 00:09:02,097
this is our chance to escape if
we don't make it out we'll be

173
00:09:02,180 --> 00:09:06,517
stuck on punk hazard move faster
we die quick let's get moving

174
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:10,257
you all heard the captain if we
don't do as she says we're dead

175
00:09:10,340 --> 00:09:15,040
come on let's go straight for
the gate don't stop for anything

176
