Well, that's taken care of.

177
00:09:21,560 --> 00:09:23,340
Hey, where'd you run off to?

178
00:09:23,720 --> 00:09:24,700
You're back!

179
00:09:25,260 --> 00:09:26,090
Yes.

180
00:09:26,173 --> 00:09:28,728
Luffy asked me to do a
little favor for him.

181
00:09:28,940 --> 00:09:31,234
You heard her, right, the Navy captain?

182
00:09:31,500 --> 00:09:33,029
Pick up the pace, brownie!

183
00:09:33,740 --> 00:09:35,564
We need to get out of here now!

184
00:09:35,820 --> 00:09:36,877
That's impossible.

185
00:09:36,960 --> 00:09:38,860
I can't go any faster.

186
00:09:40,020 --> 00:09:42,255
I'm sick to death of all this running!

187
00:09:42,820 --> 00:09:44,500
What, you tired? No!

188
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:48,040
I'm not a samurai, so I
have no problem saying it!

189
00:09:49,120 --> 00:09:50,080
I'm tired!

190
00:09:51,560 --> 00:09:52,390
Look!

191
00:09:52,473 --> 00:09:55,377
What the hell's Brownbeard
doing helping out those pirates?

192
00:09:55,460 --> 00:09:56,290
That bastard!

193
00:09:56,500 --> 00:09:58,737
How can he even think
of betraying the master?

194
00:09:58,820 --> 00:10:01,100
He's a traitor to the great savior!

195
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:02,357
We'll figure it out later!

196
00:10:02,440 --> 00:10:03,911
For now we need to hurry!

197
00:10:04,100 --> 00:10:05,277
Come on, Chief Five!

198
00:10:05,360 --> 00:10:06,713
We need to move faster!

199
00:10:06,860 --> 00:10:08,700
It's gonna close any minute!

200
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:10,040
Come on, come on!

201
00:10:11,300 --> 00:10:13,780
Experiment cannons, stand by!

202
00:10:17,940 --> 00:10:18,770
Target!

203
00:10:19,080 --> 00:10:20,420
Third laboratory!

204
00:10:21,280 --> 00:10:23,000
After wall of Building A!

205
00:10:28,220 --> 00:10:32,040
Two walls been breached!
Hey, wait! That means...

206
00:10:34,780 --> 00:10:36,800
You've got to be kidding me!

207
00:10:40,040 --> 00:10:40,980
Run! Run!

208
00:10:42,380 --> 00:10:43,210
Run!

209
00:10:47,040 --> 00:10:47,870
Reach!

210
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:49,420
Almost there now!

211
00:10:52,040 --> 00:10:52,870
Help me!

212
00:10:53,500 --> 00:10:54,360
Just reach!

213
00:10:59,880 --> 00:11:02,220
It'll close any second now!

214
00:11:02,700 --> 00:11:05,180
Anyone left on this side will be a goner!

215
00:11:19,060 --> 00:11:20,540
Hey, we're through.

216
00:11:21,120 --> 00:11:22,300
Yes, we are.

217
00:11:23,280 --> 00:11:24,320
Just barely.

218
00:11:27,500 --> 00:11:30,277
Hey, Captain just came
flying in through the gate.

219
00:11:30,360 --> 00:11:31,360
Glad you're safe.

220
00:11:31,480 --> 00:11:33,500
But how did you get here?

221
00:11:33,680 --> 00:11:34,800
Move out of my way.

222
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:37,000
There are still Marines out there.

223
00:11:37,160 --> 00:11:37,990
I'm sorry.

224
00:11:38,260 --> 00:11:39,117
It's way too dangerous.

225
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:40,920
The gate is almost close now!

226
00:11:41,060 --> 00:11:42,517
I can't just leave them behind!

227
00:11:42,600 --> 00:11:43,437
Let go of me!

228
00:11:43,520 --> 00:11:44,397
They're still out there!

229
00:11:44,480 --> 00:11:45,577
I have to help them!

230
00:11:45,660 --> 00:11:46,997
You can't go out there!

231
00:11:47,080 --> 00:11:48,315
You'll never make it!

232
00:11:48,740 --> 00:11:49,577
I have to protect them!

233
00:11:49,660 --> 00:11:50,490
No!

234
00:11:50,573 --> 00:11:51,560
I have to save them!

235
00:11:52,680 --> 00:11:53,837
